  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: DumbledoreDeath
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Humbledore
  lines:
  - Young wizard, your journey has made me proud.
  - Coldemort has done what no wizard should ever have the power to do.
  - Code that was once free to read, free to change, and free to share now belongs
    to him.
  - Among us all, only you have the power to reverse this great sin.
  - 'My dear boy, the reason the ancient guardians speak to you... '
  - .....is because.....
  - 'You are the last descendant of Sir Linus Torvalds himself.

    It''s in your
    blood.'
  - 'Go on, the final guardian awaits your arrival greatly. I think you''ll recognize
    him. '
  - I'm afraid this is where my journey ends.
  - Go on, young wizard. You are burdened with glorious purpose.
